1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Vî qiloçî tîk e, yanî pir tîk çûçik e.
 
This horn is upright, meaning the small one is very upright.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Em ê biçin gundê Kebîr... Cemal da...
 
We will go to the village of Kebir... At Cemal's...

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Bîbaka?
 
To Bibaka?

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Weê paşê gundê...
 
And afterwards the village of...

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Qoşo ye. Qoşo, Bîbaka.
 
It is Qosho. Qosho, Bibaka.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Hemşo deynê malê gund e û magû em qehwek te jî vexwin.
 
Hemsho (neighbor) owes the village house, and we said let's
drink a coffee of yours too.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Wey ser serî, mal ava. Ser serî, ser çava.
 
Oh on my head, thanks. On my head, on my eyes (You are
welcome).

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,000
E nakorim (nikarim) bi halê min... Zehmet can ra bûn. Me ra
tişt nema.
 
I cannot with my condition... It became a hardship for the
soul. Nothing is left for us.

9
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Wa bere bare çûçik na, kewal didan. Mêrê min xwar e, nabe?
 
That load is not a small load, they were giving sacks. My
husband is down/sick, is it not okay?

10
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Hem ez naxoş im, hem jinikê min naxoş e, yanî em daxwazin...
Halê me feqîr e, em feqîrê gund in. Darê zeytûnê cenetê ne.
 
Both I am sick, and my wife is sick, meaning we want... Our
situation is poor, we are the poor of the village. Olive
trees are of paradise.

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Bibako. Vê dîdê (videoyê) jî inşalla Eyn Hecerê em ê werin
teswîr kin, Eyn Hecerê.
 
Bibako. In this video too, God willing, we will come and
film Ayn Hajar, Ayn Hajar.

12
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:11,000
Selata... Selata bidem...
 
Salads... Let me give salads...

13
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Merheba hevalê me, dîsa îro vîdyokî (videoyeke) xweş kîbar
em bo we ranîn (anîn), tebe'en telebê muşahîdînê me ne.
 
Hello our friends, again today we brought a nice, lovely
video for you, of course these are the requests of our
viewers.

14
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Tebe'en qeryet... Gundê Qûta.
 
Of course the village... The village of Quta.

15
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Îro vîdyê me gundê Qûta ye. Û dû gundê Qûta ra jî em ê kin
(bi)karin Bîbaka.
 
Today our video is of Quta village. And after Quta village
we will do Bibaka.

16
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Bîbaka tebe'en em kês (kes) ser ve teswîr kin. Bi me ra bin
lextanê (lehteyên) xweş kîbar.
 
Bibaka, of course, no one has filmed it yet. Stay with us
for nice, lovely moments.

17
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Noka em ê werin nav gundê Bîbaka û Qûta em ê werin teswîr
kin. Bîr mekin layk, îştîrak me ra bi sefhê me din
(bidin)...
 
Now we will come into the village of Bibaka and Quta, we
will come film. Don't forget to give us a like, subscription
to our page...

18
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Silavê me ji we ra hene, em 'aze (hazir) têkevinê.
 
We have greetings for you, we are ready to enter it.

19
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Sabah el xêr muşahîdînê me, win çanin, îşê we çawa ye,
siheta we çawa ye. Şolê rojane rehet nin?
 
Good morning our viewers, how are you, how is your work, how
is your health. Is the daily work comfortable?

20
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Erê îro vîdyê me îro em hatine gundê Qûta no (nah)
bisawirînin ji we ra. Şolê wan ba (bi) 'ecibînin.
 
Yes, today our video, today we came to Quta village to film
for you now. May you like their work/situation.

21
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Bîr mekin layk û îştîrakê ji me ra pê (bikin/bidin) û se'eta
we gî (giş) xweş.
 
Don't forget to give us likes and subscriptions, and have a
good time all of you.

22
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Bi me ra bin, noka lextanê xweş nav gund xwa îsbat kin.
 
Stay with us, now nice moments inside the village will prove
themselves.

23
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:06,000
Û inşalla gundê dû van ra jî em ê gundê Eyn Hecerê Mezin û
Eyn Hecerê Çûçik (Biçûk) jî em ê bisawirînin.
 
And God willing, the village after these too, we will film
Ayn Hajar the Big and Ayn Hajar the Small.

24
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:26,000
Li benda me bin, vîdyokî xweş. Yalla boy boy.
 
Wait for us, a nice video. Come on, bye bye.

25
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:11,000
Tebe'en noka heke xeta serê gund herim, paşê hêdî em ê
têkevin nav gund.
 
Of course now if I go up to the top of the village, then
slowly we will enter the village.

26
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:17,000
Bi me ra bin lextanê xweş. Her gundekî vîdyû xwa îsbat kin.
 
Stay with us for nice moments. Every village video proves
itself.

27
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:30,000
Vê gundê ha tê da, mileti vir xwa îsbat kin, vîdyê wa (we)
mla (bila) pîşî giyo (gişan) keve.
 
In this village here, the people here prove themselves, may
your video fall before everyone/reach everyone.

28
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:47,000
Maşalla, hewşê kîbar di vir da hene. Welle gundekî mezin e.
 
Mashallah, there are lovely courtyards here. By God, it is a
big village.

29
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:54,000
Çi hewş di vir da hene, maşalla, bîstan çandine, hihê. Dikin
av jî li vir heye.
 
What courtyards are here, mashallah, they have planted
gardens, heh. It seems there is water here too.

30
00:03:54,000 --> 00:04:06,000
Tebe'en ev jî xwesteka hevalê me ye, bê çend neqilna ta'lîqê
da me ra nivîşt kir (nivîsî). Ma (go) gundê me gundê teswîr
kir. Xwesteka te ser çava.
 
Of course, this is also a request of our friend, [he] wrote
to us in the comments several times. Saying film our
village. Your wish is on [my] eyes (accepted).

31
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:15,000
Ser telebê muşahîd ne, muşahîd ji me xwestî. Hevalê me ne,
ehbabê me ne, xûçk û birakê me ne.
 
Upon the request of the viewers, the viewer asked us. They
are our friends, our loved ones, our sisters and brothers.

32
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:24,000
Bi hesebî zurûf no (nah), gund ne hene, meselen, gûcê (hêza)
me lê nabe, imkaniyet tune ye em nikarin xwa pî (pê) gînin
(bigihînin).
 
According to the circumstances now, there are villages, for
example, our strength doesn't reach there, there is no
possibility, we can't reach there.

33
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:28,000
Haseb (Li gorî), yanî li me 'ecle (lez) mekin, hej (hêj) lê
çîçikê qusûrê me jî efû kin.
 
So, meaning don't rush us, and forgive our small faults.

34
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:35,000
Tebe'en am navan yozmîş dikin (dinivîsin), cam (cem) xo giş
teselsel am yozmîş dikin. Haseb (li gorî) telebê gunda,
meselen, em derin.
 
Of course, we write down the names, we write them all down
in order with us. According to the request of the villages,
for example, we go.

35
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:55,000
Pir kesan sar (li ser) xas (xetê) min ra deq dikin (telefon
dikin). Ez derim.
 
Many people call me on my private line. I go.

36
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:15,000
Maşalla. Welle gundê vana jî gundê me rintir e. Çi hewş tê
da hene. Ka em herin jor, paşê em ê derin jêr.
 
Mashallah. By God, their village is better/more beautiful
than our village. What courtyards are in it. Let's go up,
then we will go down.

37
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:32,000
Hevalno bi me ra bin, em heta jor herin, cem xezanê. Paşê em
ê do (dê) kevin orta gund.
 
Friends stay with us, until we go up, to the water tank.
Then we will enter the middle of the village.

38
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:38,000
Birakê min Kawa, ev o tebe'en ser telebê birakê min Kawa ye.
Kawa Sîdo.
 
My brother Kawa, this is of course upon the request of my
brother Kawa. Kawa Sido.

39
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:46,000
Te ji me xwestî, birakê min, xwedê miradê dilê te bike. Û
inşalla em teqsîrê te ra nakin birakê min.
 
You asked us, my brother, may God grant your heart's desire.
And God willing we won't fail you, my brother.

40
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:54,000
Hevalno qenatê îştîrak kin, la dost û ehbaba bela kin.
Wellel 'ezîm dinê germ e, tizanî...
 
Friends, subscribe to the channel, distribute/share it to
friends and loved ones. By God the Almighty, the weather is
hot, you know...

41
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:58,000
Yanî em pirr 'ezab dibin. Pirr cefa ye.
 
Meaning we suffer a lot. It's a lot of hardship.

42
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:03,000
Hûn ke (ka) me ra harîkar (alîkar) kin, îşta alîkar kin,
da'm (piştgirî) kin qenatê, îştîrak kin, layka pê din.
 
Just help us, help like this, support the channel,
subscribe, give likes.

43
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:09,000
Her yek çor pênc (çar pênc) te'lîqê yozmîş kin (binivîsin).
Mila (bila) vîdyê me bişuxilin, mila cefê me orê (badîhewa)
nare.
 
Everyone write four or five comments. Let our videos
work/circulate, let our hardship not go to waste.

44
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:13,000
Çavê we gîya (gişan) maç dikim. Welle qenatê me ne wek
qenatê xelkê ye, yanî me tiştine...
 
I kiss the eyes of you all. By God our channel is not like
other people's channel, meaning we have things...

45
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:20,000
Ew bakra (belkî) na welle bes çel (40) hezar merê (mirov) li
me sêr kirin (temaşe kirin).
 
Maybe not, by God only 40 thousand people watched us.

46
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:33,000
Tebe'en an (em) noka pir jor da harin (çûn).
 
Of course we have gone very high up now.

47
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:47,000
Hevalê me vê gundê hana nîzik (nizim/nêzîk) bike, pişkê
(piçekê)... Tebe'en gundek hember min jî heye, nizanim ew
gundê kîderê ye, çend mal ne.
 
Our friend, bring this village closer a bit... Of course
there is a village opposite me too, I don't know where that
village is, there are a few houses.

48
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:51,000
Maşalla, subhanallah. Darê sünübere (sanawber/çam)... qay
(qey) darê merxê heba.
 
Mashallah, subhanallah. Pine trees... as if they were
juniper trees.

49
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:55,000
Rind e, seke (sêrke) bokî (ba kî) hênik li vir tê. Cezîbî ye
(cazîbe ye), dikişîne, dikişîne.
 
It's beautiful, look what a cool breeze comes here. It's
attractive, it pulls, it pulls.

50
00:06:55,000 --> 00:07:15,000
Hewê (hewayê) telewus (tellewuth/pîs) û dûxan (dû) ana paq
(paqij) dike. Seke çi bate... hêşinayî vê gundî jî pirr e.
 
It cleans the polluted air and smoke. Look what a [view]...
the greenery of this village is also abundant.

51
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:52,000
Wîî, li kêlekê me biskinin, inşalla ez ê antîka dilê we gîya
bikim.
 
Oh, stop at the side for me, God willing I will make the joy
of all your hearts.

52
00:07:52,000 --> 00:08:00,000
Tebe'en ez xizmetî miletê xwe da me, û... Wekî dibê heta ez
kanim (karim) ez teqsîrê kesî ra nakim.
 
Of course I am in the service of my people, and... As they
say, as long as I can, I won't fail anyone.

53
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:06,000
Na bes... in (em) e gundê gund bisawirînin. Çi garekê
(girêkê/cîhekî) kî (ku) li mentîqa Efrîn ez miste'ed me...
 
Not just... we will film village by village. Whatever place
in the Afrin region, I am ready...

54
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:26,000
Ez vêra (wê derê) horkim (herim/bigerim). Bi çi dibê mila
bibe, ez kanim li kêlakê biskinim.
 
To go there. Whatever happens let it happen, I can stop at
the side.

55
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:17,000
Tebe'en noka ez vir herim heta darê hana. Paşê em ê dakevin.
Derkê dirrê jî herim.
 
Of course now I am going from here up to those trees. Then
we will go down. I will go on the slope road too.

56
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:36,000
Milo (bila) meraq şabab (ciwan) ro nemîne. Milo hewşê giya
derkevin.
 
So that the youth don't stay curious. So that everyone's
courtyards appear.

57
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:55,000
Hevalê me diçê rma bigir (rampa bigir), mla (bila) malê giya
xuya kin.
 
Our friend, go take the ramp (slope), so that everyone's
houses show.

58
00:09:55,000 --> 00:10:15,000
Kuro em ê li vir bivtilin (bizivirin) em ê herin jor. Jam
(cem) xezanê. Paşê em ê dakevin orta gund.
 
Boy, we will turn around here, we will go up. To the water
tank. Then we will go down to the middle of the village.

59
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:25,000
Erê birako min, ev tabaan horata wa ye?
 
Yes my brother, is this naturally their gathering?

60
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:45,000
Bes no, ez ê nav gund giş teswîr kim, paşê ez ê werim
molbetê wa.
 
But now, I will film the whole village, then I will come to
their family.

61
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:53,000
Maşalla, selatu el nebî ji vî gundî ra.
 
Mashallah, prayers on the prophet for this village.

62
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:57,000
Wele serkeftin bê ji miletê me Kurd ra.
 
Success to our Kurdish nation.

63
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:59,000
Miletê Kurd cebbar e, cebbar.
 
The Kurdish nation is capable, capable.

64
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:19,000
Ez dibêjim miletê Kurd cebbar e.
 
I say the Kurdish nation is capable.

65
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:04,000
Erê hevalno, tabaan vî derê em cem Xalê Reşîd in.
 
Yes friends, of course here we are with Uncle Rashid.

66
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:06,000
Vêra dibên Ebû Delîl.
 
They call him Abu Delil.

67
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:11,000
Em hatin bin dara... sahê, tabaan saheke gind e.
 
We came under the tree... the shade, of course it's a
village shade.

68
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:16,000
Me se kir cimetekî rûniştî ye, me go em silavekî li van
bikin jî.
 
We saw a group sitting, we said let's greet them too.

69
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:19,000
Maşalla gundekî pir kîbar bî me av kir.
 
Mashallah, we saw a very neat village.

70
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:21,000
Magû merheba ji te ra Xolo.
 
I said hello to you, Uncle.

71
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:26,000
Ehlen we sehlen, ser serî min, ser çavê min. Xwedê emrê te
dirêj ke, istadê.
 
Welcome, on my head, on my eyes. May God prolong your life,
master.

72
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:29,000
Xolo, em du sê gotina ji te bipirsin.
 
Uncle, let us ask you two or three words.

73
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:30,000
Bûrin.
 
Please.

74
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:33,000
Gundî Qûta, adet sekanê gund, mol?
 
Village of Quta, number of residents of the village, houses?

75
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:37,000
Teqrîban sed heştê, sed neh, dusid heye.
 
Approximately 180, 190, 200 exist.

76
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:38,000
Dusid mol.
 
Two hundred houses.

77
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:40,000
Maşalla, miletî xo ge heye Xolo?
 
Mashallah, are all its people there, Uncle?

78
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:42,000
Miletî xo ge heye, teqrîban.
 
Its people are all there, approximately.

79
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:45,000
Maşalla, avolno teqrîban dusid mol e.
 
Mashallah, friends, approximately two hundred houses.

80
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:48,000
Û sekanî xo jî dibe adet kamil, yanî ge heye.
 
And its residents are a complete number, meaning they are
all there.

81
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:52,000
Setê te xweş, lê bi çi tê naskirin vê gundî Qûta?
 
Health to you, but what is this village Quta known by?

82
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:59,000
Vê gundî, berê, li çiyayê... gundek hebû navê xo Qûtî bûn.
 
This village, before, on the mountain... there was a village
named Quti.

83
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:03,000
Zemanda, eva kufara li hev avakiribûn Qûtî.
 
In the past, these infidels had built it together [called]
Quti.

84
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:07,000
Paşê daketin vir, çekirin... Qûta.
 
Then they came down here, made... Quta.

85
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:08,000
Nav lê nan Qûta.
 
Named it Quta.

86
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,000
Qûta.
 
Quta.

87
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:12,000
Maşalla, wele gundekî hedarî yeno.
 
Mashallah, well, it's a peaceful village.

88
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:15,000
Maşalla hewşet kîbar têdan ne Xolo?
 
Mashallah, there are neat courtyards in it, right Uncle?

89
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:19,000
Hewş kîbar in, der... Gundî me şoxilê ge du şoxil in.
 
Courtyards are neat, out... Our village works are all two
works.

90
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:22,000
Çûçikî xo, mezinê xo ge du şoxil in hetanî no.
 
Its small ones, its big ones are all two works until now.

91
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:25,000
Maşalla, serkeftin bê ji vê gundî ra.
 
Mashallah, success to this village.

92
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:27,000
Wele gundekî kîbar e min pir eciband.
 
Well, it's a neat village, I liked it a lot.

93
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:32,000
Her çend derim gundekî, ez vê gundî ji yê din pirtir di
ecibînim.
 
Whenever I go to a village, I like this village more than
the other.

94
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:38,000
Maşalla pêşketî ye, tetewirat têda pir in, seqafet têda pir
e, ne Xolo?
 
Mashallah it is developed, there are many developments in
it, much culture in it, right Uncle?

95
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,000
Waye.
 
That is so.

96
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:41,000
Setê te xweş, Xwedê emrê te dirêj bike.
 
Health to you, may God prolong your life.

97
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:43,000
Gotine te dî hene tu kî bikî Xolo?
 
Do you have other sayings you want to make, Uncle?

98
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:45,000
Bûrin, keremke, ehlen we sehlen.
 
Please, go ahead, welcome.

99
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:49,000
Bi milet ra, tu çi silavê dişînî, tu çi gotinê dikî?
 
To the people, what greetings do you send, what sayings do
you make?

100
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:51,000
Kesê dil me seyr dikin?
 
Those who watch us from the heart?

101
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:53,000
Eê silavê min ji giya ra hene.
 
Yes, my greetings are to all.

102
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:56,000
Her kesê xo ra li vê qenetê seyr dike.
 
To everyone who watches on this channel.

103
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:59,000
Ser serî min, ser çavê min, ehlen we sehlen ji we ra.
 
On my head, on my eyes, welcome to you.

104
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:01,000
Set xweş, Xwedê ji te razî be.
 
Health to you, may God be pleased with you.

105
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:03,000
Xwedê ji te jî razî be.
 
May God be pleased with you too.

106
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:06,000
Berê robînî tiştek tinnebû vê derê.
 
Before, truly, there was nothing here.

107
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:09,000
Berê kor, cefo pir bî.
 
Before, work, hardship was much.

108
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:12,000
Dawar hebî, pez hebî, cût hebî.
 
Cattle existed, sheep existed, plowing existed.

109
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:13,000
Me nan dikir.
 
We made bread.

110
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:17,000
Me dew dikutaye, me palê dichinî, me bêder dikuta.
 
We churned yogurt, we reaped harvest, we threshed.

111
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:19,000
Kor, cefo pir bî.
 
Work, hardship was much.

112
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:21,000
Zilamê we qet alîkarî dikirin?
 
Did your men ever help?

113
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:26,000
Na, nan ne, ne palê ne, ne şuxlê me, ne jardar ma, tiş nemû.
 
No, not bread, not reaping, not our work, not our cleaning,
nothing.

114
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,000
Tiş nemû.
 
Nothing.

115
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:28,000
