Çiqas sal heye emrê gundê Xalo?
 
How many years old is the village, Uncle?

283
00:25:29,000 --> 00:25:32,000
Emrê xwe teqrîben ser du sed sala heye ev hewşa.
 
Its age is approximately over two hundred years, this
courtyard.

284
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:36,000
Emrê vê hewşê ser du sed sala heye Xalo dibê.
 
Uncle says the age of this courtyard is over two hundred
years.

285
00:25:36,000 --> 00:25:37,000
Maşallah kavnor e.
 
Mashallah, it is ancient.

286
00:25:37,000 --> 00:25:40,000
Lê kevn e, hewşa bopîrê me û kalê me hew e şte.
 
Yes it is old, it is the courtyard of our forefathers and
grandfathers.

287
00:25:40,000 --> 00:25:41,000
Ewa, bopîrê me.
 
Yes, our forefathers.

288
00:25:41,000 --> 00:25:44,000
Maşallah. Xalo gundî we bi çê tên naskirin?
 
Mashallah. Uncle, what is your village known for?

289
00:25:44,000 --> 00:25:48,000
Jidar noj, xulû pirs kir, tê berrin dana, me'lûmat ew na
dikin.
 
From here, friend ask, give them the info, they don't have
information.

290
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:51,000
Gundî me bi navê Qel'a tê naskirin, Qutî vêr dibên.
 
Our village is known by the name of the Castle, they call it
Qutî.

291
00:25:51,000 --> 00:25:52,000
Qutî? Quton vêr dibên.
 
Qutî? They call it Quton.

292
00:25:52,000 --> 00:25:53,000
Quton?
 
Quton?

293
00:25:53,000 --> 00:25:54,000
Ewa, Qel'a.
 
Yes, the Castle.

294
00:25:54,000 --> 00:25:55,000
Serê çiyayê Berkoşê.
 
On top of the Berkoşê mountain.

295
00:25:55,000 --> 00:25:57,000
Berkoşê, me'lûmatêk hew jî rind e, serê çiyayê Berkoşê.
 
Berkoşê, that information is also good, on top of the
Berkoşê mountain.

296
00:25:57,000 --> 00:25:59,000
Berkoşê paş vir e, ne wye?
 
Berkoşê is behind here, isn't it?

297
00:25:59,000 --> 00:26:01,000
Berkoşê paş me dikeve erê.
 
Berkoşê falls behind us, yes.

298
00:26:01,000 --> 00:26:05,000
Temam, xo bi me ra bin hewalno.
 
Okay, stay with us friends.

299
00:26:05,000 --> 00:26:08,000
Erê hewalno, maşallah vê hewşa pirr kavnor e.
 
Yes friends, mashallah this courtyard is very ancient.

300
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:09,000
Kavnor e lê.
 
It is ancient, yes.

301
00:26:09,000 --> 00:26:11,000
Xalo te go emrê xwe çiqas sal e?
 
Uncle, you said how old is it?

302
00:26:11,000 --> 00:26:12,000
Ez bixwe vê çorê me.
 
I myself was born in it.

303
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:14,000
Bave çorê?
 
Born in it?

304
00:26:14,000 --> 00:26:16,000
Maşallah.
 
Mashallah.

305
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:21,000
Xalo dibê ez bave çorê me divê hewşê da, pirr hewşek kavnor
e.
 
Uncle says I was born in this courtyard, it is a very
ancient courtyard.

306
00:26:21,000 --> 00:26:23,000
Qat hirmaye.
 
It has layers of stone.

307
00:26:23,000 --> 00:26:27,000
Tebhen diqûrî ye, yanî qolingbîniya gundê mitrek heye.
 
Of course it is a cave, meaning the thickness of the wall is
one meter.

308
00:26:27,000 --> 00:26:30,000
Xo vê binî istêr jî, hew jî emrê xwe çend salî ye ev?
 
And this structure beneath, how old is it?

309
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:36,000
Emrê wê, teqrîben di sala 72 da buwe kirine, nu... di 72 da
buwe kirine.
 
Its age, approximately in the year 72 my father was born,
now... in '72 he was born.

310
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:39,000
72 da? Yanî teqrîben nêzîkî 50 salî.
 
In 72? Meaning approximately close to 50 years.

311
00:26:39,000 --> 00:26:42,000
50 û du sal buwe hatî vî bîrê me.
 
50 and two years since he came to my memory.

312
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:47,000
50 û du sal ne, bes vê ewî pirtiya bi buwe kir ne, tê bîrê
xalû.
 
52 years, but the stone it was built with, it is in Uncle's
memory.

313
00:26:47,000 --> 00:26:48,000
Kavnor e.
 
It is ancient.

314
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:54,000
Maşallah, maşallah. Wela hênik e jî milet. Hênik e hewşa
xalû pirr hênik e.
 
Mashallah, mashallah. By God it is cool too, people. It is
cool, Uncle's courtyard is very cool.

315
00:26:54,000 --> 00:26:56,000
Diqûrî ye.
 
It is a cave.

316
00:26:56,000 --> 00:26:58,000
Avînê hênik e, havînê jî germ e.
 
In summer it is cool, in winter it is warm.

317
00:26:58,000 --> 00:27:01,000
De bere gî pixara tê da xistin, agir tê da xistin.
 
In the past they lit fireplaces in it, they lit fire in it.

318
00:27:01,000 --> 00:27:05,000
Li ber çurçuna kewal didan, meşkê xwarin, ne wye?
 
They gave animals food by the manger, drank buttermilk,
isn't it?

319
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:08,000
Lê welê erê.
 
Yes, just like that.

320
00:27:08,000 --> 00:27:09,000
Saeta te xweş Xalo.
 
Good health to you, Uncle.

321
00:27:09,000 --> 00:27:11,000
We te jî xweş erê, ser çava hatin.
 
Good health to you too, yes, welcome.

322
00:27:11,000 --> 00:27:20,000
Vê qolpinê wa, wekî têla vêr digotin kaşgî, pişkul pêva
dibûn, me're ke şmircê xwe çake ser, desmalê xwe, çemê çake
ser, bitûnî.
 
These hooks there, like wires they called "kaşgî", they hung
dung on it, men hung their whips, their handkerchiefs, their
clothes on it, everything.

323
00:27:20,000 --> 00:27:21,000
Wek te'lîqê?
 
Like a hanger?

324
00:27:21,000 --> 00:27:23,000
Ewa, ewa.
 
Yes, yes.

325
00:27:23,000 --> 00:27:24,000
Saeta te xweş.
 
Good health to you.

326
00:27:24,000 --> 00:27:25,000
We te jî xweş.
 
Good health to you too.

327
00:27:25,000 --> 00:27:27,000
Maşallah hênik e.
 
Mashallah, it is cool.

328
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:28,000
Lê.
 
Yes.

329
00:27:28,000 --> 00:27:29,000
Dilê me ne xwest em ji vir rabin.
 
We didn't want to leave here.

330
00:27:29,000 --> 00:27:31,000
Ê, hello û sehlo.
 
Yes, welcome.

331
00:27:31,000 --> 00:27:35,000
Erê hewalno, bi me ra bin, tebhen noka emê herin gundî
kîlakê bisewirînin.
 
Yes friends, stay with us, of course now we will go film the
village next door.

332
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:38,000
Bibokê, gundî Bibokê jî emê ser wa teswîr kin inşallah.
 
Bibokê, we will film the village of Bibokê too, God willing.

333
00:27:38,000 --> 00:27:41,000
Bi me ra bin, saeta we xweş.
 
Stay with us, good health to you.

334
00:27:41,000 --> 00:27:47,000
Erê saeta Xalo xweş, Xwedê te razî be, Xwedê Pêxember te
razî be, çavê we maç dikim.
 
Yes, good health to Uncle, may God be pleased with you, may
God and the Prophet be pleased with you, I kiss your eyes.

335
00:27:47,000 --> 00:28:07,000
Maxatira xwe ji we xwest.
 
He asked to take his leave from you.

336
00:29:24,000 --> 00:29:29,000
Erê hewalno, tebhen li vir jî em hatin mefraqa gundî Bibokê.
 
Yes friends, of course here we arrived at the junction of
Bibokê village.

337
00:29:29,000 --> 00:29:32,000
Em kê herin mala Ebu Mistefa, mala gundmên (Muxtar).
 
We will go to the house of Abu Mustafa, the Mukhtar's house.

338
00:29:32,000 --> 00:29:36,000
Em kê hen wî derê jî vîdyo kîçê kin, nav gundî gundê jî emê
teswîr kin tebhen.
 
We will go there and make a video clip, we will film inside
the village too of course.

339
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:37,000
Birakî me ji me xwestî.
 
My brother asked us.

340
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:41,000
Bi me ra bin noka gundî, gundê emê teswîr kin, mala Ebu
Mistefa.
 
Stay with us, now the village, we will film the village, the
house of Abu Mustafa.

341
00:29:41,000 --> 00:29:45,000
Bibokê, ser serî min, ser çavê min.
 
Bibokê, upon my head, upon my eyes.

342
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:47,000
Yallah ya Xwedê.
 
Let's go, oh God.

343
00:29:47,000 --> 00:29:50,000
Em têkevin gund, mefraqê.
 
We enter the village, the junction.

344
00:29:50,000 --> 00:29:53,000
Erê wela.
 
Yes, by God.

345
00:29:53,000 --> 00:29:59,000
Qijqijê zikî min e, a Nezro mir me, ti dibê ti miniyê da
hasbînî, na miniyê ye axa birakê min, na miniyê ye.
 
My stomach is growling, Nezro died man, you say you will
count it as a favor, no it's not a favor my brother, not a
favor.

346
00:29:59,000 --> 00:30:00,000
Bes çîçik e yanî teqdîrî me ro bike.
 
But it is small, meaning appreciate us.

347
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Em didin meda hemkine bi qenatê îştîrakê, bi bîst hezar
meriva li me seyr dikin, qenat yanî îştîrakê me hindik in...
 
We are trying to support the channel with subscriptions,
twenty thousand people watch us, but the channel
subscriptions are few...

348
00:30:06,000 --> 00:30:10,000
Ez daxwazim hûn reklamê liser dikin, qenat... da cefayê me
derkeve.
 
I ask you to [watch] the ads on it, the channel... so that
our efforts pay off.

349
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:14,000
Ma'ne hatim gundekî, me ware sewirînin... cefayê me derkeve.
 
Meaning, I came to a village, come let's film... so that our
effort pays off.

350
00:30:14,000 --> 00:30:19,000
Heke kesek rabe bêje ko pere medin ser qenatê, pere meriv
bişîne hem gundî we teswîr ke.
 
If someone gets up and says don't give money to the channel,
send money so people can film your villagers too.

351
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:22,000
Min çêkiriya her gund a telebê we ye winêmca.
 
I have done every village at your request, you see.

352
00:30:22,000 --> 00:30:42,000
Teb'en her kasek wekî dibê rêye xwaye, ser serî min ser çavê
min te'lîqê tero, çavî birayê xwe maç dikim.
 
Of course, everyone has their own opinion, your comments are
highly respected [on my head and eyes], I kiss my brother's
eyes.

353
00:30:45,000 --> 00:31:05,000
Teb'en navê gund teswîr kim paşê em herin mala mêvanê me.
 
Of course, I will film the name of the village, then we will
go to our host's house.

354
00:33:38,000 --> 00:33:45,000
Erê hevalno, teb'en hemûtan gundê Bîbako... Em rast xalê me
hatin bi rê ket...
 
Yes friends, of course, all of you [know] the village of
Biboko... We came directly to our uncle, we set off...

355
00:33:45,000 --> 00:33:48,000
Min got navê wî nizanim, bes a bonê tem de şor...
 
I said I don't know his name, but the subscription...

356
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:52,000
Meriv got navê min ezbenî, me got na wala cema'et qenat
heye.
 
Someone said "my name is sir", we said "no, actually, folks,
there is a channel".

357
00:33:52,000 --> 00:33:55,000
Em sekin xwasteka xalo çiye, li vî derî telebno xalo wane...
 
Let's see what the uncle's request is, here are the requests
of the uncle...

358
00:33:55,000 --> 00:33:57,000
Dozdeh... dengekî liser qenatê min.
 
Twelve... a voice on my channel.

359
00:33:57,000 --> 00:34:01,000
Û zira tune, ew jî xêr bike, û meriv a xêrxwaz kê... pir
sewab e, se'eteke xweş.
 
And there is no agriculture, may he do good too, and
charitable people... it is a great reward, a good hour.

360
00:34:01,000 --> 00:34:02,000
Em sekin xwasteka xalo çiye. Xalo...
 
Let's see what the uncle's request is. Uncle...

361
00:34:02,000 --> 00:34:08,000
Ez nexweş im, ez şerawî me... Evarî kî ye, ez şerawî me.
 
I am sick, I am from Shera... Who is Evari, I am from Shera.

362
00:34:08,000 --> 00:34:12,000
Mala Elî Çîlo kes me nas nake? Ez ji mala Elî Çîlo me.
 
Does no one know the house of Ali Chilou? I am from the
house of Ali Chilou.

363
00:34:12,000 --> 00:34:15,000
Te bibihîse Elî... Elî pirin, bavê min Elî pirin.
 
You might hear Ali... There are many Alis, my father [says]
there are many Alis.

364
00:34:15,000 --> 00:34:18,000
Elî Çîlo... di gund tev da me'rûf e.
 
Ali Chilou... is famous in the whole village.

365
00:34:18,000 --> 00:34:19,000
Di gundê Şera.
 
In the village of Shera.

366
00:34:19,000 --> 00:34:22,000
Navê min jî Henan... Ebdilhenan gindî me.
 
My name is also Hanan... Abdulhanan from the village.

367
00:34:22,000 --> 00:34:24,000
Ebdilhenan miskînê Sûriyêsî.
 
Abdulhanan, the poor Syrian.

368
00:34:24,000 --> 00:34:25,000
Temam.
 
Okay.

369
00:34:25,000 --> 00:34:26,000
Xwasteka te çine?
 
What are your requests?

370
00:34:26,000 --> 00:34:30,000
Xwasteka min... hem ez nexweş im, hem jinka min nexweş e...
 
My request... I am sick, and my wife is sick...

371
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:32,000
Yanî em dixwazin... halê me feqîr e.
 
Meaning we want... our situation is poor.

372
00:34:32,000 --> 00:34:35,000
Feqîrê gund... dar û zeytûnê ceme'etê ne.
 
The poor of the village... the trees and olives belong to
the community.

373
00:34:35,000 --> 00:34:37,000
Erd tune, milk tune.
 
No land, no property.

374
00:34:37,000 --> 00:34:39,000
Feqîrê gund em e bes.
 
We are just the poor of the village.

375
00:34:39,000 --> 00:34:41,000
Temam, ee nexweşiya te çiye begî?
 
Okay, uh, what is your illness exactly?

376
00:34:41,000 --> 00:34:43,000
Nexweşiya min... Ekzîma ye.
 
My illness... is eczema.

377
00:34:43,000 --> 00:34:47,000
Erê hevalno ekzîma ye, teb'en rûçikê xalo, serê xalo vragê
birîn e.
 
Yes friends, it's eczema, naturally the uncle's face, the
uncle's head is full of sores.

378
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:49,000
Ekzîma ye nexweş e.
 
It is eczema, it is sick.

379
00:34:49,000 --> 00:34:50,000
Û kelfeta te nexweşiya wê çiye?
 
And what is your wife's illness?

380
00:34:50,000 --> 00:34:51,000
Seretan.
 
Cancer.

381
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:53,000
Seretan biddem... Seretan biddem.
 
Cancer in the blood... Cancer in the blood.

382
00:34:53,000 --> 00:34:56,000
Xwedê rehetîyê bide, çavê gundî lê maşîkin.
 
May God grant relief, may the villagers keep an eye on her.

383
00:34:56,000 --> 00:34:59,000
Û lawê min jî heye... nexweşiya xwe wêran e...
 
And I have a son too... his illness is terrible...

384
00:34:59,000 --> 00:35:05,000
Sikir... Me'de ye... nexweşiya wî me'de ye.
 
Sugar [Diabetes]... It's the stomach... his illness is the
stomach.

385
00:35:05,000 --> 00:35:08,000
Yanî navê... kesê jê ra bixwe vexe.
 
Meaning the name... someone to eat and drink for him.

386
00:35:08,000 --> 00:35:10,000
Navê xwa Mihemed e... Mihemed miskîn.
 
His name is Mohammed... Poor Mohammed.

387
00:35:10,000 --> 00:35:12,000
Em sisê... em sisê nexweş in.
 
We three... we three are sick.

388
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:14,000
Sisê nexweş in, hûn biyanê gundê Şera ne?
 
Three are sick, are you strangers to the village of Shera?

389
00:35:14,000 --> 00:35:18,000
Erê hevalno, xalo dengê xwe têkine ji her yekî Kurd.
 
Yes friends, the uncle's voice is gone [pleading] to every
Kurd.

390
00:35:18,000 --> 00:35:21,000
Kesê daxwazê... bi xêrekê bike, bi xalo ra harîke...
 
Anyone who wants... to do a good deed, help the uncle...

391
00:35:21,000 --> 00:35:23,000
Ezê çavê gindê maç kim.
 
I will kiss the villagers' eyes.

392
00:35:23,000 --> 00:35:28,000
Teb'en... we, vê ro harîkir se'eta we xweş, we harînekir
dîsa se'eta we xweş.
 
Of course... you, if you helped today, bless you, if you
didn't help, bless you again.

393
00:35:28,000 --> 00:35:32,000
Hawa qortix li we dimîne, xalo hewa xwa ber me kir.
 
The burden remains on you, the uncle turned his air [hope]
towards us.

394
00:35:32,000 --> 00:35:37,000
Û me jî naxwest em bişixilînin... belkî mehek xêrxwaz hebin,
vê ro harîkin.
 
And we didn't want to make him work... maybe there is a
month of charitable people, to help today.

395
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:41,000
Kêlekê vekin, hew jî fiqorokî gundê me ye, mentîqa me ye.
 
Open a side [offer help], he is also a poor person of our
village, our region.

396
00:35:41,000 --> 00:35:46,000
Mentîqa Kurmênc e... dest teng e... şta... nexweşî jî ewê
xwa tenê ye.
 
The Kurmanj region... is tight-handed [poor]... look... the
illness is its own thing too.

397
00:35:46,000 --> 00:35:48,000
Xwedê nexweşiyê nade tu kesî, Xwedê rehetîyê bide.
 
God does not give illness to anyone [hopefully], may God
grant relief.

398
00:35:48,000 --> 00:35:49,000
Sisê em nexweş in malê.
 
We three are sick in the house.

399
00:35:49,000 --> 00:35:51,000
Me daxwaza we ro harîkin.
 
We ask you to help today.

400
00:35:51,000 --> 00:35:54,000
Ê ji Şera hatiye vêra, nav gunda digere.
 
He came from Shera to here, wandering among the villages.

401
00:35:54,000 --> 00:35:56,000
Me go xalo reqemê xwe telefunê jî me de.
 
We said uncle, give us your phone number too.

402
00:35:56,000 --> 00:35:57,000
Ê reqemê xwe jî nizane.
 
He doesn't even know his number.

403
00:35:57,000 --> 00:35:58,000
Min hifiz nekiriye reqemê.
 
I haven't memorized the number.

404
00:35:58,000 --> 00:36:02,000
Hifiz nekiriye, kesê daxwazê... vê ro alîkar ke...
 
Hasn't memorized it, anyone who wants... to help today...

405
00:36:02,000 --> 00:36:05,000
Me ra tewasil kin, teb'en reqemê min li ser e, di wesfê da.
 
Contact us, of course my number is above, in the
description.

406
00:36:05,000 --> 00:36:09,000
Kanin me ra tewasil kin, û ez kanim herim gundê xalo Şera.
 
You can contact us, and I can go to the uncle's village,
Shera.

407
00:36:09,000 --> 00:36:14,000
Û em herin bi deng û sûret... em biçin xalo bibînin... em
emanetê gund bigihînin.
 
And we will go with sound and image... we will go see the
uncle... we will deliver the village's trust [donation].

408
00:36:14,000 --> 00:36:15,000
Û ew ehwalê gund jî emê sekin.
 
And we will check the condition of the village too.

409
00:36:15,000 --> 00:36:16,000
Yanî... mal.
 
Meaning... home.

410
00:36:16,000 --> 00:36:21,000
Û me ra îcab kir, emê herin xwa bigihînin mala gundê... me
enwanê kamil jê girtî, emê herin cem.
 
And if it is necessary for us, we will go and reach the
house of the village... we took the full address from him,
we will go to him.

411
00:36:21,000 --> 00:36:28,000
Lawê min Mihemed miskîn e, nexweşiya ser vê re... dibil kes
vê re nexwe... doxtoran...
 
My son Mohammed is wretched, the illness is on top of
this... no one eats with him... doctors...

412
00:36:28,000 --> 00:36:30,000
Ne bi kepçe, ne bi sehana...
 
Not with a ladle, not with plates...

413
00:36:30,000 --> 00:36:37,000
Û ewa jî û jinka jî... dibê vano... nîzîk e ezê bimrim...
tiştî ez jî jê vêkevim nexweşiyê.
 
And that one and the wife too... she says these... it is
close that I will die... something that I will also fall
from the illness.

414
00:36:37,000 --> 00:36:42,000
Xwedê rehetîyê bide te de, û înşela xêrxwaz hene, te ra
harîkin xalo, se'eta te xweş.
 
May God grant you relief, and God willing there are
charitable people, they will help you uncle, bless you.

415
00:36:42,000 --> 00:36:43,000
Û ez çavê giya maç dikim.
 
And I kiss everyone's eyes.

416
00:36:43,000 --> 00:36:46,000
Şera bes tu pirs ke mala Elî Çîlo... me nas dikin.
 
In Shera just ask for the house of Ali Chilou... they know
us.

417
00:36:46,000 --> 00:36:50,000
Mişkila tune, xalo me ra bes tewasil kirin bi çavî xwe, ezê
bi makîna xwe werim cem te.
 
No problem, uncle just contacted us with his own eyes, I
will come to you with my car.

418
00:36:50,000 --> 00:36:54,000
Û emê wez'î te jî sekin, û emê... xelkê çi ew kir, emanetê
te jî bidin te.
 
And we will check your situation, and we will... whatever
the people did [donated], we will give you your trust.

419
00:36:54,000 --> 00:36:57,000
Sisê... sisê ji mala me nexweş in. Xwedê hewarê we be.
 
Three... three from our house are sick. May God be your
