number.

421
00:37:01,000 --> 00:37:04,000
Ê mecbûr divê me ra ew bikin emê... xwa bigihînin te inşala.
 
So necessarily they must [contact] us, we will... reach you
God willing.

422
00:37:04,000 --> 00:37:06,000
Ekil hal, Şera... pirs ke...
 
In any case, Shera... ask...

423
00:37:06,000 --> 00:37:09,000
Ez Şera giş dizanim, ez mal bi mal te nas dikim. Emê werin
cê bikin inşala.
 
I know all of Shera, I know you house by house. We will come
and fix it God willing.

424
00:37:09,000 --> 00:37:10,000
Tê werî cê bikî?
 
You will come and fix it?

425
00:37:10,000 --> 00:37:13,000
