426
00:37:13,000 --> 00:37:14,000
Hinda nabe, hinda nabe?
 
Is it not here, is it not here?

427
00:37:14,000 --> 00:37:16,000
Xalo tu ji vî gundî ye?
 
Uncle are you from this village?

428
00:37:16,000 --> 00:37:17,000
Ee.
 
Yes.

429
00:37:17,000 --> 00:37:19,000
Se'eta te xweş, xwedê ji te razî be heval sêr bike.
 
Bless you, may God be pleased with you friend look.

430
00:37:19,000 --> 00:37:21,000
Xalo gundê we çima nav kirin Bîboko?
 
Uncle, why did they name your village Biboko?

431
00:37:21,000 --> 00:37:23,000
Bi çi... navê xêlê kirin Bîboko?
 
With what... did they name the tribe Biboko?

432
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:24,000
Ee.
 
Yes.

433
00:37:24,000 --> 00:37:27,000
Bîboko bi Tirkî yanî qijik çûçik e.
 
Biboko in Turkish means small bird.

434
00:37:27,000 --> 00:37:28,000
Qijik çûçik e?
 
Small bird?

435
00:37:28,000 --> 00:37:31,000
Ee, ew tercime erebî kirin, gotin Tifle.
 
Yes, they translated it to Arabic, they said "Tifle"
[Child/Baby].

436
00:37:31,000 --> 00:37:33,000
Bi erebî gotin Tifle.
 
In Arabic they said Tifle.

437
00:37:33,000 --> 00:37:34,000
Bi erebî gotin Tifle?
 
In Arabic they said Tifle?

438
00:37:34,000 --> 00:37:36,000
Bes bi Tirkî Bîboko... Bîboko şax e.
 
But in Turkish Biboko... Biboko is a branch.

439
00:37:36,000 --> 00:37:37,000
Qijik çûçik e.
 
Small bird.

440
00:37:37,000 --> 00:37:39,000
Qijik çûçik e. Bi erebî jî Tifle yanî qijik çûçik e.
 
Small bird. In Arabic too Tifle means small bird.

441
00:37:39,000 --> 00:37:40,000
Eywa.
 
Yes.

442
00:37:40,000 --> 00:37:41,000
Ser serî min ser çavê min.
 
On my head, on my eyes [Welcome].

443
00:37:41,000 --> 00:37:42,000
Ere wala.
 
Yes, by God.

444
00:37:42,000 --> 00:37:47,000
Xwedê ji we razî be, maşala mewqehêk pir xweş e gundê we, û
tebî'eta xwa jî xweş e.
 
May God be pleased with you, Mashallah your village has a
very nice location, and its nature is nice too.

445
00:37:47,000 --> 00:37:49,000
De ber... ca ye... tiştî bi ştaş da...
 
It is... a place... something with stones...

446
00:37:49,000 --> 00:37:56,000
Xalo gotina te hene, te miletro tu silavkê bişînî, tu dibê
çi miletî me yê vane... bela bibînin li... tumtumî
