448
00:37:58,000 --> 00:37:59,000
Sa'eta te xweş.
 
Bless you.

449
00:37:59,000 --> 00:38:00,000
Vêca... halê me... ha wina rewşa...
 
So... our situation... like this is the situation...

450
00:38:00,000 --> 00:38:04,000
Xalo me'îşetê gundo çawa ye? Wed'ê gundo çawa ye? Me'îşet...
yanî me'îşet çawa ye?
 
Uncle how is the livelihood of the villages? How is the
condition of the villages? Livelihood... meaning how is the
livelihood?

451
00:38:04,000 --> 00:38:06,000
Wlehî de bêje xerab e.
 
By God, say it is bad.

452
00:38:06,000 --> 00:38:11,000
Wlehî de bêje xerab e, hevalno madem hîn bi halê hene zanin.
 
By God, say it is bad, friends since you still know the
