453
00:38:11,000 --> 00:38:12,000
Êwa.
 
Yes.

454
00:38:12,000 --> 00:38:14,000
Yanî têş dikave, rind dibe?
 
Meaning does it fall into place, does it get good?

455
00:38:14,000 --> 00:38:18,000
Eh lê... roj ro ye... elhemdu lîlah rind dibe heçkê.
 
Eh well... it is day by day... praise be to God it gets good
