456
00:38:18,000 --> 00:38:19,000
Rind e, se'eta te xweş xalo.
 
It is good, bless you uncle.

457
00:38:19,000 --> 00:38:20,000
Emê kil hal...
 
We will in any case...

458
00:38:20,000 --> 00:38:21,000
Wehenan jî dengê... nexweşiya wî...
 
And Hanan too the voice... his illness...

459
00:38:21,000 --> 00:38:23,000
Temam mişkîla tune. El muhîm hevalno...
 
Okay no problem. The important thing friends...

460
00:38:23,000 --> 00:38:27,000
Sa'eta vê mêrana jî xweş, û xwedê emrê te dirêj bike xalo.
 
Bless these men too, and may God lengthen your life uncle.

461
00:38:27,000 --> 00:38:32,000
Em dîsa bibêjin, kesê xêrxwaz, daxwazê xalî miro harîke,
