462
00:38:32,000 --> 00:38:35,000
Û emê bi sot û sûra, emê mala xalo...
 
And we will with sound and image, we will [go] to uncle's
house...

463
00:38:35,000 --> 00:38:36,000
Ena bi efras el mot...
 
I am on the deathbed...

464
00:38:36,000 --> 00:38:41,000
Ew jî xêra miriya we ye, da'wîkê zekatek xwa, vê cejnê berî
cejnê...
 
That is also the charity for your dead, a claim of your
Zakat, this Eid before the Eid...

465
00:38:41,000 --> 00:38:42,000
Ena bi efras el mot...
 
I am on the deathbed...

466
00:38:42,000 --> 00:38:46,000
Yanî teyîfûn na tişt e... werin cem camiyê, mala min cem
camiyê ye.
 
Meaning the phone is not a thing... come to the mosque, my
house is next to the mosque.

467
00:38:46,000 --> 00:38:48,000
Camiyê Şera xêrî gundê tana.
 
The mosque of Shera is the charity of the whole village.

468
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:51,000
Bes bê mala Elî Çîlo eyp e ta re wabe.
 
Just say the house of Ali Chilou, it is a shame if it is
like that for you.

469
00:38:51,000 --> 00:38:57,000
Temam, te dinya, eyb e, damilo xêra wabe, xêra miriya wabe,
wabe çi kanî vê ro harîkir...
 
Okay, the world, it is shame, as long as there is charity,
charity for the dead, whatever they could help today...

470
00:38:57,000 --> 00:38:59,000
Yanî nexweşî bi vanit... sir û ewe...
 
Meaning the illness with these... secret and that...

471
00:38:59,000 --> 00:39:00,000
Xwedê rehetîyê bide.
 
May God grant relief.

472
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:01,000
Emrê min... şêst sal e.
 
My age... is sixty years.

473
00:39:01,000 --> 00:39:02,000
Şêst sal e?
 
Sixty years?

474
00:39:02,000 --> 00:39:05,000
Ena efras el mot... ena 'umrî aktar minnî...
 
I am on the deathbed... I am older than him...

475
00:39:05,000 --> 00:39:07,000
Xwedê rehetîyê bide, Xwedê rehetîyê bide te.
 
May God grant relief, may God grant you relief.

476
00:39:07,000 --> 00:39:09,000
Ewel berra, ewel marra... heba...
 
First time, first time... if there was...

477
00:39:09,000 --> 00:39:12,000
Xwedê rehetîyê bide, inşala xêrxwaz hene, ey miletê me,
