478
00:39:12,000 --> 00:39:14,000
Wa şebab wa zarok dîme?
 
And the youth and children saw me?

479
00:39:14,000 --> 00:39:16,000
Ecera hatime vir.
 
I just came here.

480
00:39:16,000 --> 00:39:17,000
Ee, dibêjin Ebdilhenan.
 
Yes, they say Abdulhanan.

481
00:39:17,000 --> 00:39:19,000
Ee ezê dikim, îne dikim xalo.
 
Yes I will do it, I will do it [post it] uncle.

482
