483
00:39:24,000 --> 00:39:28,000
Û kurê min, ew ser... edol merezan xeter, bikellif mesarî.
 
And my son, that head [issue]... these are dangerous
diseases, they cost money.

484
00:39:28,000 --> 00:39:30,000
Hene... qul... mewt ketîr.
 
There is... say... much death.

485
00:39:30,000 --> 00:39:32,000
Bes tinne ekter minnî.
 
But there isn't more than me.

486
00:39:32,000 --> 00:39:39,000
Xulu miletê me kurmanc, xêrxwaz tê da pir in, û pir bav di
