492
00:39:54,000 --> 00:39:56,000
Û dengê min dere, ê dewletî derve...
 
And my voice goes out, to the state abroad...

493
00:39:56,000 --> 00:40:00,000
Ê viderê jî û ê dewletî derve...
 
The one here too and the one in the state abroad...

494
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:02,000
Here, ewa lê na... Saeta te xweş...
 
Go ahead, that one no... Bless you...

495
00:40:02,000 --> 00:40:05,000
Xwedê Teala bi rehma xwe li banê erdê, li rehma xwe li sema
