Our people, their tears... anyway your manner is nicer...
[those in] foreign countries are also alone...

498
00:40:15,000 --> 00:40:17,000
Jina min wez naxoşim.
 
My wife and I are sick.

499
00:40:17,000 --> 00:40:21,000
Teb'en de gi te... milet gi gune ne inşallah, ew tiştê ji
