500
00:40:21,000 --> 00:40:23,000
Rûndikê wî, em bîr nakin.
 
His tears, we will not forget.

501
00:40:23,000 --> 00:40:27,000
Inşallah xwedê we, bes mirov îcab kirin, ezê bi çavê xwe
werim cem te.
 
God willing, may God [bless] you, if people respond (send
aid), I will come to you with my own eyes (in person).

502
00:40:27,000 --> 00:40:33,000
Ser çava, tu noqte zêde navêjî, ezê hejmara te bidim
