come to you, film you, and fix it for the uncle.

503
00:40:33,000 --> 00:40:35,000
Xwedê ji we razî be, lawê min.
 
May God be pleased with you, my son.

504
00:40:35,000 --> 00:40:37,000
Emê malbatê te bi du qat jî zanin.
 
We will know your family twice as well (we will take double
care).

505
00:40:37,000 --> 00:40:43,000
Temam muşkîla tine, hemî xwedê girin, hemî werin cem te,
teswîr kî ji te re çêkin û hemî bela kin ji miletê
musilmanletî me re.
 
Okay, no problem, everyone holds onto God, everyone will
come to you, film it and fix it for you, and distribute it
to our Muslim people.

506
00:40:43,000 --> 00:40:46,000
Rebî ale mîn, xwedê miletê me yê kurmanc, bes...
 
Lord of the worlds, may God [bless] our Kurdish people,
enough...

507
00:40:46,000 --> 00:40:48,000
Xwedê destê xwe ser ra bigire.
 
May God hold His hand over them.

508
00:40:48,000 --> 00:40:52,000
Inşallah, ewa lo bimeşin, saeta we xweş, xwedê bextê we bar
bike, xwedê ji we razî be.
 
God willing, let's walk (drive) that way, bless you, may God
