Xalo gundê we çiqas e mala teqanîban?
 
Uncle, how big is your village, approximately?

512
00:41:07,000 --> 00:41:09,000
Xwe sed pêncî mal bûn.
 
It was a good one hundred and fifty houses.

513
00:41:09,000 --> 00:41:10,000
Sed û pêncî mal?
 
One hundred and fifty houses?

514
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:13,000
Sed û pêncî hebûn, hemû jî zêde bûn.
 
There were one hundred and fifty, and all of them were full
