515
00:41:13,000 --> 00:41:14,000
Maşallah.
 
Mashallah (God has willed it).

516
00:41:14,000 --> 00:41:17,000
Bes, î... î pir xerab bûn.
 
But, uh... uh, they were very ruined.

517
00:41:17,000 --> 00:41:19,000
Ewa ş ş ş... em çar pênc mal ketine gund.
 
Those sh sh sh... we are four or five houses left in the
village.

518
00:41:19,000 --> 00:41:21,000
Tek yek wa şo şo şo tî çî ki ye...
 
Only one wa sho sho sho [mumbling/sound effects describing
