519
00:41:21,000 --> 00:41:24,000
Heryêk birin, heftê jî zêmet kêş bûn.
 
They took each one, seventy also suffered hardship.

520
00:41:24,000 --> 00:41:25,000
Eywa.
 
I see.

521
00:41:25,000 --> 00:41:26,000
Vêga tişt nemaye.
 
Now nothing remains.

522
00:41:26,000 --> 00:41:27,000
Erê rind e be, erê rind e be.
 
Yes let it be good, yes let it be good.

523
00:41:27,000 --> 00:41:33,000
Erê rind e inşallah, ewê rind e be.
 
Yes it is good God willing, it will be good.

524
00:41:33,000 --> 00:41:35,000
Inşallah.
 
God willing.

525
