526
00:41:37,000 --> 00:41:38,000
Arê, arê.
 
Yes, yes.

527
00:41:38,000 --> 00:41:40,000
Catekê xana, catekê jî dên e.
 
One time it's [like an] inn, one time it's [like a] debt.

528
00:41:40,000 --> 00:41:43,000
Ser çavê min, ser çavê min xalo.
 
With pleasure, with pleasure uncle (On my eyes).

529
00:41:43,000 --> 00:41:44,000
Wele.
 
By God.

530
00:41:44,000 --> 00:41:47,000
Bîrê me yê kevin, yê avê tîk ji.
 
Our old wells, the water ones are also dry/empty.

531
00:41:47,000 --> 00:41:49,000
Ewa yê barazan, kûstera xwe rûdixistin.
 
That one of the pigs/boars, they were driving their coaster
