532
00:41:49,000 --> 00:41:51,000
Welle maşallah, xwedê jê terab bike lê.
 
By God Mashallah, may God fix/improve it though.

533
00:41:51,000 --> 00:41:52,000
Inşallah.
 
God willing.

534
00:41:52,000 --> 00:41:55,000
Welle xalo vê mentîqê no pir xweş in ha.
 
By God uncle, this area is very nice, ha.

535
