Xweş kiro bûn.
 
They were made nice.

540
00:42:04,000 --> 00:42:05,000
Xweş kirî bûn?
 
They had been made nice?

541
00:42:05,000 --> 00:42:16,000
Belê.
 
Yes.

542
00:42:16,000 --> 00:42:18,000
Welle xalo, xelk pir heyfşê digre.
 
By God uncle, people feel great regret (or miss the
